<!-- REINFORCEMENTS on guard kill. General formula (compared to MV ref):
* +1 system set to start=true. (If clonebay/medbay, do both)
* Add the required power for said system
* +1 min Weapons power
* Half of the weapons are random generically-usable RK, alternating with ref's list.
* +2 missiles
* +2 hull
* +2 min crew (or however many to reach 5), +2 max crew -->

